# The checked type of Base is a type variable. The classes that the calls in sight hand over are the parents that the class may have: Position is handed Entity, and Velocity is handed what position() answers,
# whose type is an intersection of constructor types with the class Position in front. So Velocity has room for x, which its constraint Made<Entity> says nothing of.
